# .gitleaksignore — triaged false positives for snoby-demo-org/xelis-blockchain.
# Populated ONLY from real scan findings of the TrueNorth secrets-scan leg
# (required class): each entry is <file>:<rule-id>:<fingerprint> as reported by
# the job log. Upstream test fixtures / published public constants get triaged
# here; anything that looks like a live credential does NOT — rotate it.
#
# NOTE (gitleaks v8.30): fingerprints embed the scan-target path, so entries
# must be listed in BOTH forms when the module scans a mounted /src:
#   src/foo.rs:<rule>:<hash>      (local `gitleaks dir .`)
#   /src/src/foo.rs:<rule>:<hash> (CI exec)
#
# Empty after the first green run = nothing to triage.
